{"id":"n44167-2-6","stage":2,"title":"닳다 · 浓缩","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n44167-2-6-1","ko":"찌개가 좀 많이 짜네.","zh":"汤有点太咸了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"찌개가","meaning":"浓汤，汤，锅","explanation":"찌개：浓汤，汤，锅；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"찌개","audio":"/audio/ab54be0a69403de061db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26901","senseId":"1","lemma":"찌개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짜네.","meaning":"咸","explanation":"짜다：咸；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"짜다","audio":"/audio/2a62c1820e5f4c49c8d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71578","senseId":"1","lemma":"짜다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab54be0a69403de0","term":"찌개","zh":"浓汤，汤，锅","audio":"/audio/ab54be0a69403de061db.mp3","entryId":"26901","definition":"一种微咸的菜肴，在容器中放入少量汤汁后放入肉、豆腐或蔬菜等食材，再放入适量的辣椒酱或大酱等作料和酱油煮制而成。","pronunciation":["찌개"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"2a62c1820e5f4c49","term":"짜다","zh":"咸","audio":"/audio/2a62c1820e5f4c49c8d9.mp3","entryId":"71578","definition":"味道和盐一样。","pronunciation":["짜다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0142e48205ff24470ad5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n44167-2-6-2","ko":"그래? 국물이 너무 닳았나 보다.","zh":"是吗？大概是汤汁熬得太少了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그