249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/863bfd146c2d3a8bbe45.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.996,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=44167","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":66,"sequenceScore":1.6494,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？大概是汤汁熬得太少了。","汤有点太咸了。","今天真的好热啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["汤有点太咸了。","今天真的好热啊。","是吗？大概是汤汁熬得太少了。"],"answer":2}]}
